---
import { PUBLIC_LINE_ADD_FRIEND_URL } from 'astro:env/client';
const url = PUBLIC_LINE_ADD_FRIEND_URL;
---
<section class="bg-[#e9f8ef]" aria-label="公式LINE">
  <div class="container-x flex flex-col items-center gap-5 py-10 text-center sm:flex-row sm:text-left">
    <span class="grid size-14 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-line text-white" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 3C6.5 3 2 6.6 2 11c0 3.9 3.5 7.2 8.3 7.9.3.1.8.2.9.5.1.3.1.7 0 1l-.1.9c0 .3-.2 1 .9.5s5.9-3.5 8-6C21.4 14.3 22 12.7 22 11c0-4.4-4.5-8-10-8Z" /></svg>
    </span>
    <div class="flex-1">
      <p class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-night-900">公式LINEで最新のセミナー情報をお届けします</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">開催日程のお知らせ、会計・経営のミニコラム、LINE限定のご案内を配信中。</p>
    </div>
    {url
      ? <a href={url} class="btn-line" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LINEで友だち追加</a>
      : <span class="btn-line opacity-60 cursor-not-allowed" title="公式LINE準備中">LINEで友だち追加（準備中）</span>}
  </div>
</section>
